## Rules

- **2-space indentation** everywhere
- **`@Observable @MainActor`** for view models — no `ObservableObject`
- **`async/await`** only — no `DispatchQueue`
- **Sorted imports**
- **No `print()`**, no `fatalError()`, no force-unwrap (`!`)
- **No `// swiftlint:disable`** — fix the root cause

These rules are enforced by `.swiftlint.yml`. The linter will fail your CI build if you break them.

## Verification (before every commit)

```bash
swiftlint lint --fix --config .swiftlint.yml
swiftlint lint --config .swiftlint.yml          # must show 0 violations
__TEST_COMMAND__                                # must pass
```

